        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Linear Algebra Notes</title>\n    <script>\n      MathJax = {\n        tex: {\n          inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']],\n          displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']]\n        },\n        svg: {\n          fontCache: 'global'\n        }\n      };\n    </script>\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n      src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\">\n    </script>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n            background-color: #e0e0e0;\n            color: #222;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 20px;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n        }\n        .page {\n            background-color: #fff;\n            padding: 40px 50px;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n            max-width: 850px;\n            width: 100%;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n        }\n        \n        .indent-1 { margin-left: 20px; }\n        .indent-2 { margin-left: 40px; }\n        .indent-3 { margin-left: 70px; }\n        .indent-4 { margin-left: 100px; }\n        \n        .row {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n        }\n        \n        .mb-small { margin-bottom: 10px; }\n        .mb-medium { margin-bottom: 20px; }\n        .mb-large { margin-bottom: 30px; }\n        .mt-small { margin-top: 10px; }\n        .mt-medium { margin-top: 20px; }\n        \n        .grid-theorem {\n            display: grid; \n            grid-template-columns: 2fr 2fr 1fr; \n            gap: 10px; \n            align-items: center;\n        }\n        \n        .grid-props {\n            display: grid; \n            grid-template-columns: auto auto auto; \n            gap: 10px 40px; \n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .side-panel {\n            min-width: 160px;\n            padding-left: 20px;\n            border-left: 1px dashed #ddd;\n        }\n        \n        .annotation {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 0.85em;\n            color: #555;\n            margin-top: -5px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"page\">\n        <div class=\"indent-1\">4. 两个 $n$ 阶方阵乘积的行列式等于行列式的乘积</div>\n        <div class=\"indent-2\">$|AB| = |A||B|$</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"indent-1 mt-small\">★ 设 $A_1, A_2 \\dots, A_m$ 都为$n$阶方阵，则 $|A_1A_2 \\dots A_m| = |A_1||A_2|\\dots|A_m|$</div>\n        <div class=\"indent-2\">推论: 设 $A$ 为$n$阶方阵，则 $|kA| = k^n|A|$</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"indent-3 mt-small\">例. $A,B$均为$n$阶方阵， $|A|=a \\neq 0$ ，若 $AB+2E=0$ 求$|B|$</div>\n        <div class=\"indent-4\">$|AB| = |A||B| = a|B| = |-2E| = (-2)^n$</div>\n        <div class=\"indent-4\">$\\therefore |B| = (-2)^n \\cdot \\frac{1}{a}$</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"mb-medium\"></div>\n\n        <div>5. 转置矩阵记为 $A^T$</div>\n        <div class=\"indent-1 grid-theorem mt-small\">\n            <div>☆ 定理: $(A^T)^T = A$</div>\n            <div>$(A+B)^T = A^T + B^T$</div>\n            <div>$|A| = |A^T|$</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"indent-1 grid-theorem\">\n            <div style=\"padding-left: 65px;\">$(kA)^T = k A^T$</div>\n            <div>$(AB)^T = B^T A^T$</div>\n            <div></div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"indent-1 mt-small\">\n            若 $A^T = A$ ，则 $A$为 对称矩阵 ，若 $A^T = -A$ ，则 $A$为 反对称矩阵\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mb-large\"></div>\n\n        <div>6. 可逆矩阵 : 有$n$阶方阵$A, B$，使 $AB=E=BA$ ，则称$A$为可逆矩阵，$B$为$A$的逆矩阵</div>\n        <div class=\"indent-2\">逆矩阵是唯一的 ， $A$的唯一逆矩阵记为 $A^{-1}$</div>\n\n        <div class=\"row mt-small\" style=\"justify-content: space-between;\">\n            <div style=\"flex-grow: 1;\">\n                <div class=\"indent-2\">证唯一: $AB=E=BA \\quad AC=E=CA$</div>\n                <div class=\"indent-4\">$B = BE = B(AC) = (BA)C = EC = C$</div>\n                \n                <div class=\"row mt-medium\">\n                    <div class=\"indent-2\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;\">\n                        <div>☆ <span style=\"font-size: 1.1em;\">$A^{-1} = \\frac{1}{|A|} A^*$</span></div>\n                        <div class=\"annotation\" style=\"margin-left: 30px;\">↑</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"margin-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;\">\n                        <span style=\"font-size: 1.1em;\">$A^* = \\begin{bmatrix} A_{11} & A_{21} & \\dots & A_{n1} \\\\ A_{12} & A_{22} & \\dots & A_{n2} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots \\\\ A_{1n} & A_{2n} & \\dots & A_{nn} \\end{bmatrix}$</span>\n                        <div class=\"annotation mt-small\">↑<br>伴随矩阵 每个位置上放代数余子式再转置</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"side-panel\">\n                <div style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">- 二阶伴随矩阵</div>\n                $A = \\begin{bmatrix} a & b \\\\ c & d \\end{bmatrix}$<br><br>\n                $A^* = \\begin{bmatrix} d & -b \\\\ -c & a \\end{bmatrix}$<br><br>\n                <div style=\"font-size: 0.9em;\">对角交换，副对角变号</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mb-medium\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"indent-1\">★ $A \\cdot A^* = |A| \\cdot E = A^* \\cdot A$</div>\n        <div class=\"indent-3\">推: $( \\frac{1}{|A|} \\cdot A^* ) A = E$</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"indent-1 row mt-small\" style=\"gap: 50px;\">\n            <div>若 $|A| = 0$ ，则 $|A^*| = 0$</div>\n            <div>$|A^*| = |A|^{n-1}$</div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"mt-small\">$A$ 可逆 $\\Leftrightarrow |A| \\neq 0$</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"row mt-medium\">\n            <div style=\"width: 50px;\">性质:</div>\n            <div class=\"grid-props\">\n                <div>$|A^{-1}| = |A|^{-1}$</div>\n                <div>$(A^T)^{-1} = (A^{-1})^T$</div>\n                <div></div>\n                \n                <div>$|A^{-1}| = \\frac{1}{|A|}$</div>\n                <div>$(A^{-1})^{-1} = A$</div>\n                <div>$(kA)^{-1} = \\frac{1}{k} A^{-1}$</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
